    "alert_id": "P006_MISSING_PLAN_CPT",
    "title": "No clinician plan documented; CPT and monitoring gaps",
    "message": "No assessment or plan was documented for this visit. Guidelines prioritize cotrimoxazole preventive therapy (CPT) for all PLHIV newly initiating on ART and for pregnant/breastfeeding women. This patient, 10 weeks into ART and pregnant, appears eligible but no CPT is listed among medications. Additionally, guidelines require HBV screening (HBsAg) for all PLHIV initiating ART; no HBV screening result is documented. TDF-containing ART is appropriate if HBV co-infected, making screening important for completeness of care.",
    "issue_type": "plan_add",
